      "t": "2026-11-09T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "China's commerce ministry has extended its suspension of export restrictions on certain rare earths, industrial diamonds, and lithium battery technology to January 10, 2027.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-09:6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-09T00:00:06Z",
      "text": "The extension comes amid ongoing trade negotiations with the United States.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-09:6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-09T00:00:11Z",
      "text": "According to the first Trump administration, these practices may contribute to the US–China trade deficit, and the Chinese government requires the transfer of American technology to China.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383990841:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-09T00:00:18Z",
      "text": "The map places this story in China.",
